  "mach:judgementReason": "The standard open-source image data management platform for microscopy and bioimaging. Deployed at hundreds of research institutions globally, supports 150+ formats via Bio-Formats, and provides Python/Java/MATLAB APIs for programmatic access. GPL-2.0; commercial support available via Glencoe Software. Primarily Linux server deployment. The go-to choice for any research institute managing large-scale microscopy or digital pathology data.",
